# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This tutorial demonstrates how to implement **Approximate Quantum "
"Compilation** using tensor networks (AQC-Tensor) with Qiskit to enhance "
"quantum circuit performance. AQC-Tensor compresses deep Trotter circuits "
"into shallower, more hardware-friendly circuits while preserving simulation "
"accuracy.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tutorial ini menunjukkan cara mengimplementasikan **Kompilasi Kuantum "
"Aproksimasi** menggunakan tensor network (AQC-Tensor) dengan Qiskit untuk "
"meningkatkan performa sirkuit kuantum. AQC-Tensor mengompresi sirkuit "
"Trotter yang dalam menjadi sirkuit yang lebih dangkal dan ramah perangkat "
"keras sambil mempertahankan akurasi simulasi.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "How AQC-Tensor works {#how-aqc-tensor-works}"
msgstr "Cara kerja AQC-Tensor {#how-aqc-tensor-works}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Consider simulating a Hamiltonian $H$ for total time $t$ using $k$ Trotter "
"steps. The full Trotter circuit is:\n"
msgstr ""
"Pertimbangkan simulasi Hamiltonian $H$ untuk waktu total $t$ menggunakan $k$"
" langkah Trotter. Sirkuit Trotter penuh adalah:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"U_{\\text{full}} = \\left[U_{\\text{Trotter}}(t/k)\\right]^k\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"U_{\\text{full}} = \\left[U_{\\text{Trotter}}(t/k)\\right]^k\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A naive approach uses few Trotter steps to keep circuit depth manageable, "
"but this introduces significant Trotter error. AQC-Tensor resolves this "
"tension by separating accuracy from depth:\n"
msgstr ""
"Pendekatan naif menggunakan sedikit langkah Trotter untuk menjaga kedalaman "
"sirkuit tetap terkelola, tetapi ini memperkenalkan error Trotter yang "
"signifikan. AQC-Tensor menyelesaikan ketegangan ini dengan memisahkan "
"akurasi dari kedalaman:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Target circuit (high accuracy, deep):** Construct a Trotter circuit with "
"many steps&mdash;say, $10k$&mdash;for the same evolution time. This circuit "
"has far less Trotter error, but is too deep for hardware. Because it is only"
" simulated classically as a matrix product state (MPS), depth is not a "
"concern.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Sirkuit target (akurasi tinggi, dalam):** Bangun sirkuit Trotter dengan "
"banyak langkah&mdash;misalnya, $10k$&mdash;untuk waktu evolusi yang sama. "
"Sirkuit ini memiliki error Trotter yang jauh lebih sedikit, tetapi terlalu "
"dalam untuk perangkat keras. Karena hanya disimulasikan secara klasik "
"sebagai matrix product state (MPS), kedalaman bukanlah masalah.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Ansatz circuit (low depth, parametrized):** Define a parametrized circuit "
"$V(\\theta)$ with the same structure as a single-step Trotter circuit. "
"Initialize it so that $V(\\theta_{\\text{init}}) = "
"U_{\\text{Trotter}}(t/k)$, then iteratively optimize $\\theta$ so that "
"$V(\\theta)$ reproduces the high-accuracy target state as closely as "
"possible.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Sirkuit ansatz (kedalaman rendah, terparametrisasi):** Definisikan sirkuit"
" terparametrisasi $V(\\theta)$ dengan struktur yang sama seperti sirkuit "
"Trotter satu langkah. Inisialisasi sehingga $V(\\theta_{\\text{init}}) = "
"U_{\\text{Trotter}}(t/k)$, lalu iteratif optimalkan $\\theta$ sehingga "
"$V(\\theta)$ mereproduksi state target berkeakurasi tinggi sedekat "
"mungkin.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The result is a circuit that retains the depth of a single Trotter step but "
"achieves the accuracy of many, making it feasible for near-term quantum "
"hardware.\n"
msgstr ""
"Hasilnya adalah sirkuit yang mempertahankan kedalaman satu langkah Trotter "
"tetapi mencapai akurasi banyak langkah, membuatnya layak untuk perangkat "
"keras kuantum near-term.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "When to use AQC-Tensor {#when-to-use-aqc-tensor}"
msgstr "Kapan menggunakan AQC-Tensor {#when-to-use-aqc-tensor}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "AQC-Tensor is most effective when:\n"
msgstr "AQC-Tensor paling efektif ketika:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Circuit depth exceeds hardware coherence times.** If a Trotter simulation "
"requires more Trotter steps than the device can support, AQC-Tensor can "
"compress the evolution into a shallower circuit.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Kedalaman sirkuit melebihi waktu koherensi perangkat keras.** Jika "
"simulasi Trotter membutuhkan lebih banyak langkah Trotter daripada yang "
"dapat didukung perangkat, AQC-Tensor dapat mengompresi evolusi menjadi "
"sirkuit yang lebih dangkal.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Entanglement remains classically tractable.** The total entanglement in a "
"time-evolved state depends primarily on the evolution time $t$, not the "
"number of Trotter steps $k$. This means a target circuit with $10k$ steps is"
" typically no harder to represent as an MPS than one with $k$ steps, as long"
" as $t$ is short enough for bond dimensions to stay manageable.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Entanglement tetap dapat dihitung secara klasik.** Total entanglement "
"dalam state yang berevolusi waktu bergantung terutama pada waktu evolusi "
"$t$, bukan jumlah langkah Trotter $k$. Ini berarti sirkuit target dengan "
"$10k$ langkah biasanya tidak lebih sulit untuk direpresentasikan sebagai MPS"
" daripada dengan $k$ langkah, selama $t$ cukup pendek agar dimensi bond "
"tetap terkelola.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**A natural ansatz exists.** Because the ansatz mirrors the structure of a "
"Trotter circuit, it provides a physically motivated starting point with "
"well-defined initial parameters, avoiding the convergence issues that can "
"plague arbitrary variational ansatze.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Ada ansatz alami.** Karena ansatz mencerminkan struktur sirkuit Trotter, "
"ansatz memberikan titik awal yang termotivasi secara fisik dengan parameter "
"awal yang terdefinisi dengan baik, menghindari masalah konvergensi yang "
"dapat menghantui ansatz variasional sewenang-wenang.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This approach contrasts with generic circuit compression: rather than trying"
" to approximate an arbitrary unitary with fewer gates, AQC-Tensor keeps the "
"same gate structure and optimizes its parameters to reduce Trotter error. "
"See the [AQC-Tensor documentation](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-"
"aqc-tensor/) for more information.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pendekatan ini berbeda dengan kompresi sirkuit generik: alih-alih mencoba "
"mengaproksimasi unitary sewenang-wenang dengan lebih sedikit gate, AQC-"
"Tensor mempertahankan struktur gate yang sama dan mengoptimalkan "
"parameternya untuk mengurangi error Trotter. Lihat [dokumentasi AQC-"
"Tensor](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-aqc-tensor/) untuk informasi "
"lebih lanjut.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This tutorial guides you through the full state-preparation AQC-Tensor "
"workflow: defining a Hamiltonian, generating Trotter circuits, compressing "
"them via tensor-network optimization, and executing the result on IBM "
"Quantum&reg; hardware.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tutorial ini memandu kamu melalui alur kerja persiapan state AQC-Tensor "
"secara lengkap: mendefinisikan Hamiltonian, membuat sirkuit Trotter, "
"mengompresnya melalui optimasi tensor network, dan mengeksekusi hasilnya di "
"perangkat keras IBM Quantum&reg;.\n"

