# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Small-scale simulator example {#small-scale-simulator-example}"
msgstr "Contoh simulator skala kecil {#small-scale-simulator-example}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This section uses a 10-site system to illustrate the AQC-Tensor workflow "
"step by step. We simulate the dynamics of a 10-site XXZ spin chain, a widely"
" studied model for examining spin interactions and magnetic properties.\n"
msgstr ""

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The Hamiltonian is as follows:\n"
msgstr ""
"Bagian ini menggunakan sistem 10-situs untuk mengilustrasikan alur kerja "
"AQC-Tensor langkah demi langkah. Kita mensimulasikan dinamika rantai spin "
"XXZ 10-situs, model yang banyak dipelajari untuk mengkaji interaksi spin dan"
" sifat magnetik.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\hat{\\mathcal{H}}_{XXZ} = \\sum_{i=1}^{L-1} J_{i,(i+1)}\\left(X_i X_{(i+1)}+Y_i Y_{(i+1)}+ 2\\cdot Z_i Z_{(i+1)} \\right) \\, ,\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"Hamiltoniannya adalah sebagai berikut:\n"
"$$\n"
"\\hat{\\mathcal{H}}_{XXZ} = \\sum_{i=1}^{L-1} J_{i,(i+1)}\\left(X_i X_{(i+1)}+Y_i Y_{(i+1)}+ 2\\cdot Z_i Z_{(i+1)} \\right) \\, ,\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"where $J_{i,(i+1)}$ is a random coefficient for edge $(i, i+1)$ and "
"$L=10$.\n"
msgstr ""
"di mana $J_{i,(i+1)}$ adalah koefisien acak untuk edge $(i, i+1)$ dan "
"$L=10$.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Step 1: Map classical inputs to a quantum problem {#step-1-map-classical-"
"inputs-to-a-quantum-problem}"
msgstr ""
"Langkah 1: Petakan input klasik ke masalah kuantum {#step-1-map-classical-"
"inputs-to-a-quantum-problem}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In this step, we:\n"
"1. Define the Hamiltonian, observable, and initial state.\n"
"2. Compute the exact expectation value classically for later comparison.\n"
"3. Generate a high-accuracy Trotter circuit (the AQC target) and compress it into a low-depth ansatz using AQC-Tensor.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pada langkah ini, kita:\n"
"1. Mendefinisikan Hamiltonian, observabel, dan state awal.\n"
"2. Menghitung nilai ekspektasi yang tepat secara klasik untuk perbandingan nantinya.\n"
"3. Membuat sirkuit Trotter berkeakurasi tinggi (target AQC) dan mengompresnya menjadi ansatz berkedalaman rendah menggunakan AQC-Tensor.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set up the Hamiltonian, observable, and initial state {#set-up-the-"
"hamiltonian-observable-and-initial-state}"
msgstr ""
"Menyiapkan Hamiltonian, observabel, dan state awal {#set-up-the-hamiltonian-"
"observable-and-initial-state}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/approximate-"
"quantum-compilation-for-time-evolution/extracted-outputs/527dbada-1.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/approximate-"
"quantum-compilation-for-time-evolution/extracted-outputs/527dbada-1.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Compute the exact expectation value {#compute-the-exact-expectation-value}"
msgstr ""
"Menghitung nilai ekspektasi yang tepat {#compute-the-exact-expectation-"
"value}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For a system of this size, we can compute the exact time-evolved expectation"
" value directly using matrix exponentiation. This serves as our ground truth"
" for evaluating the AQC circuit's accuracy.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk sistem seukuran ini, kita dapat menghitung nilai ekspektasi yang tepat"
" dari waktu-evolusi secara langsung menggunakan eksponen matriks. Ini "
"berfungsi sebagai kebenaran dasar kita untuk mengevaluasi akurasi sirkuit "
"AQC.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Generate the AQC target circuit {#generate-the-aqc-target-circuit}"
msgstr "Membuat sirkuit target AQC {#generate-the-aqc-target-circuit}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We now construct the Trotter circuit that will serve as the AQC target. This"
" circuit uses many Trotter steps (32) for high accuracy. Because it will "
"only be simulated classically as an MPS&mdash;not executed on "
"hardware&mdash;the large depth is not a concern.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita sekarang membangun sirkuit Trotter yang akan berfungsi sebagai target "
"AQC. Sirkuit ini menggunakan banyak langkah Trotter (32) untuk akurasi yang "
"tinggi. Karena hanya akan disimulasikan secara klasik sebagai "
"MPS&mdash;bukan dieksekusi di perangkat keras&mdash;kedalaman yang besar "
"bukanlah masalah.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Generate an ansatz, initial parameters, subsequent circuit, and a baseline "
"circuit {#generate-an-ansatz-initial-parameters-subsequent-circuit-and-a-"
"baseline-circuit}"
msgstr ""
"Membuat ansatz, parameter awal, sirkuit berikutnya, dan sirkuit baseline "
"{#generate-an-ansatz-initial-parameters-subsequent-circuit-and-a-baseline-"
"circuit}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Next, we construct a \"good\" circuit with the same evolution time as the "
"AQC target but far fewer Trotter steps (only one). We pass this circuit to "
"`generate_ansatz_from_circuit`, which returns:\n"
msgstr ""
"Selanjutnya, kita membangun sirkuit \"baik\" dengan waktu evolusi yang sama "
"dengan target AQC tetapi jauh lebih sedikit langkah Trotter (hanya satu). "
"Kita meneruskan sirkuit ini ke `generate_ansatz_from_circuit`, yang "
"mengembalikan:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A general, parametrized **ansatz** circuit with the same two-qubit "
"connectivity.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sirkuit **ansatz** terparametrisasi yang umum dengan konektivitas dua-qubit "
"yang sama.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Initial parameters** that reproduce the input circuit when plugged into "
"the ansatz.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Parameter awal** yang mereproduksi sirkuit input ketika dimasukkan ke "
"dalam ansatz.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We also construct:\n"
"- A **subsequent circuit** with one Trotter step that will be appended (uncompressed) after the AQC-optimized portion, following the approach in the [AQC-Tensor initial state tutorial](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-aqc-tensor/tutorials/01_initial_state_aqc.html).\n"
"- A **baseline Trotter circuit** using four Trotter steps over the full evolution time (`aqc_evolution_time + subsequent_evolution_time`). This serves as the comparison: it represents what you would run on hardware without AQC. The AQC ansatz (3 compressed steps + 1 uncompressed step) achieves better accuracy at lower depth.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita juga membangun:\n"
"- Sebuah **sirkuit berikutnya** dengan satu langkah Trotter yang akan ditambahkan (tidak dikompres) setelah bagian yang dioptimalkan AQC, mengikuti pendekatan dalam [tutorial state awal AQC-Tensor](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-aqc-tensor/tutorials/01_initial_state_aqc.html).\n"
"- Sebuah **sirkuit Trotter baseline** menggunakan empat langkah Trotter selama waktu evolusi penuh (`aqc_evolution_time + subsequent_evolution_time`). Ini berfungsi sebagai pembanding: mewakili apa yang akan kamu jalankan di perangkat keras tanpa AQC. Ansatz AQC (3 langkah terkompres + 1 langkah tidak terkompres) mencapai akurasi yang lebih baik pada kedalaman yang lebih rendah.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/approximate-"
"quantum-compilation-for-time-evolution/extracted-outputs/78f2665e-1.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/approximate-"
"quantum-compilation-for-time-evolution/extracted-outputs/78f2665e-1.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set up tensor network simulation and build the target MPS {#set-up-tensor-"
"network-simulation-and-build-the-target-mps}"
msgstr ""
"Menyiapkan simulasi tensor network dan membangun MPS target {#set-up-tensor-"
"network-simulation-and-build-the-target-mps}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We use the [quimb](https://github.com/jcmgray/quimb) matrix-product state "
"(MPS) circuit simulator, with JAX providing automatic differentiation for "
"the gradient-based optimization. We then build an MPS representation of the "
"target state and evaluate the starting fidelity between the initial ansatz "
"and the target. As the problem instance is a relatively small example, the "
"starting fidelity starts off quite high.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita menggunakan simulator sirkuit matrix-product state (MPS) "
"[quimb](https://github.com/jcmgray/quimb), dengan JAX menyediakan "
"diferensiasi otomatis untuk optimasi berbasis gradient. Kita kemudian "
"membangun representasi MPS dari state target dan mengevaluasi fidelitas awal"
" antara ansatz awal dan target. Karena contoh masalahnya cukup kecil, "
"fidelitas awal dimulai cukup tinggi.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Optimize the ansatz parameters {#optimize-the-ansatz-parameters}"
msgstr "Mengoptimalkan parameter ansatz {#optimize-the-ansatz-parameters}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We minimize the `MaximizeStateFidelity` cost function using the L-BFGS-B "
"optimizer. The optimizer iteratively adjusts the ansatz parameters to "
"maximize the fidelity between the ansatz circuit and the target MPS.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita meminimalkan fungsi biaya `MaximizeStateFidelity` menggunakan optimizer"
" L-BFGS-B. Optimizer secara iteratif menyesuaikan parameter ansatz untuk "
"memaksimalkan fidelitas antara sirkuit ansatz dan MPS target.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Assemble the final AQC circuit {#assemble-the-final-aqc-circuit}"
msgstr "Merakit sirkuit AQC akhir {#assemble-the-final-aqc-circuit}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"With the optimized parameters in hand, we bind them to the ansatz and then "
"append the subsequent (uncompressed) Trotter step. The resulting circuit has"
" the depth of a single compressed Trotter step plus one uncompressed step, "
"but the compressed portion approximates the accuracy of 32 Trotter steps.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dengan parameter yang dioptimalkan, kita mengikat parameter tersebut ke "
"ansatz lalu menambahkan langkah Trotter berikutnya (tidak dikompres). "
"Sirkuit yang dihasilkan memiliki kedalaman satu langkah Trotter terkompres "
"ditambah satu langkah tidak terkompres, tetapi bagian terkompres mendekati "
"akurasi 32 langkah Trotter.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/approximate-"
"quantum-compilation-for-time-evolution/extracted-outputs/e09e40de-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/approximate-"
"quantum-compilation-for-time-evolution/extracted-outputs/e09e40de-0.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Step 2: Optimize problem for quantum hardware execution {#step-2-optimize-"
"problem-for-quantum-hardware-execution}"
msgstr ""
"Langkah 2: Optimalkan masalah untuk eksekusi perangkat keras kuantum "
"{#step-2-optimize-problem-for-quantum-hardware-execution}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For this small-scale example, we use a fake backend (`FakeKyiv`) to simulate"
" hardware execution locally. We transpile both the AQC-optimized circuit "
"(`aqc_final_circuit`) and the baseline Trotter circuit (`baseline_circuit`, "
"four Trotter steps over the full evolution time, no AQC) to the backend's "
"instruction set architecture (ISA), with `optimization_level=3` to further "
"reduce circuit depth.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk contoh skala kecil ini, kita menggunakan backend palsu (`FakeKyiv`) "
"untuk mensimulasikan eksekusi perangkat keras secara lokal. Kita melakukan "
"transpilasi sirkuit yang dioptimalkan AQC (`aqc_final_circuit`) dan sirkuit "
"Trotter baseline (`baseline_circuit`, empat langkah Trotter selama waktu "
"evolusi penuh, tanpa AQC) ke instruction set architecture (ISA) backend, "
"dengan `optimization_level=3` untuk lebih mengurangi kedalaman sirkuit.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Step 3: Execute using Qiskit primitives {#step-3-execute-using-qiskit-"
"primitives}"
msgstr ""
"Langkah 3: Eksekusi menggunakan primitif Qiskit {#step-3-execute-using-"
"qiskit-primitives}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We use the [`EstimatorV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/estimator-v2) primitive with the fake backend to run both the AQC-"
"optimized circuit and the baseline Trotter circuit, measuring the ZZ "
"observable for each.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita menggunakan primitif "
"[`EstimatorV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/estimator-v2) dengan backend palsu untuk menjalankan sirkuit yang "
"dioptimalkan AQC dan sirkuit Trotter baseline, mengukur observabel ZZ untuk "
"masing-masing.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Step 4: Post-process and return result in desired classical format "
"{#step-4-post-process-and-return-result-in-desired-classical-format}"
msgstr ""
"Langkah 4: Pasca-proses dan kembalikan hasil dalam format klasik yang "
"diinginkan {#step-4-post-process-and-return-result-in-desired-classical-"
"format}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We extract the expectation values from both runs and compare them to the "
"exact result. The baseline Trotter circuit shows what we would get without "
"AQC at the same circuit depth, while the AQC circuit demonstrates the "
"improvement from tensor-network optimization.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita mengekstrak nilai ekspektasi dari kedua run dan membandingkannya dengan"
" hasil yang tepat. Sirkuit Trotter baseline menunjukkan apa yang akan kita "
"dapatkan tanpa AQC pada kedalaman sirkuit yang sama, sementara sirkuit AQC "
"mendemonstrasikan perbaikan dari optimasi tensor network.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/approximate-"
"quantum-compilation-for-time-evolution/extracted-outputs/77c39ba8-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/approximate-"
"quantum-compilation-for-time-evolution/extracted-outputs/77c39ba8-0.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Large-scale hardware example {#large-scale-hardware-example}"
msgstr "Contoh perangkat keras skala besar {#large-scale-hardware-example}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We now scale up to a 50-site XXZ model to demonstrate AQC-Tensor on a more "
"realistic problem size. The workflow is the same as the small-scale example:"
" we compress three Trotter steps via AQC and append one uncompressed step.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita sekarang meningkatkan skala ke model XXZ 50-situs untuk "
"mendemonstrasikan AQC-Tensor pada ukuran masalah yang lebih realistis. Alur "
"kerjanya sama dengan contoh skala kecil: kita mengompresi tiga langkah "
"Trotter melalui AQC dan menambahkan satu langkah tidak terkompres.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For a system of this size, matrix exponentiation is infeasible ($2^{50}$ "
"dimensions), so we compute the reference expectation value directly from a "
"high-accuracy MPS evolved for the full time.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk sistem seukuran ini, eksponen matriks tidak layak dilakukan ($2^{50}$ "
"dimensi), sehingga kita menghitung nilai ekspektasi referensi langsung dari "
"MPS berkeakurasi tinggi yang berevolusi selama waktu penuh.\n"

